{"parentUuid":"e26e1a19-9311-4cf5-b0f5-b75a83436ddb","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6f37bbaf-3b2a-4889-9da8-014105b65b82","agentId":"acb4e62e0c603bceb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016WJQd5SMU9bepYtFEVCSmt","type":"tool_result","content":"# OR-Tools Release Versions 9.15 and Later\n\nBased on the provided content, only **v9.15** is documented as a release version 9.15 or later. Here are the details:\n\n## v9.15\n**Release Date:** January 12, 2026\n\n**URL:** https://github.com/google/or-tools/releases/tag/v9.15\n\n**Key CP-SAT Changes:**\n- \"Improvements to the `no_overlap_2d` constraint (presolve, propagation, and cuts)\"\n- \"Detect, store and use precedences in presolve, propagation, and cuts\"\n- \"Extensive work on LRAT proof production and checking\"\n- \"Improve linear1 and linear2 encodings and processing\"\n- \"Support for set variables and constraints (experimental)\"\n- \"Extend support for enforcement literals to more constraints\"\n- Performance optimization for Python layer and improved typing support\n- Enhanced shared tree workers and clause sharing capabilities\n- Multiple bug fixes and heuristic improvements\n\n---\n\n**Note:** The webpage content provided does not include releases numbered 9.16, 9.17, 9.18, 10.0, or any versions beyond 9.15. The visible release history shows v9.15 as the latest version, with earlier versions (v9.14, v9.13, v9.12, etc.) documented below it."}]},"uuid":"112ab924-662b-447c-b457-c5aa9fbf9862","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:58:48.416Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e26e1a19-9311-4cf5-b0f5-b75a83436ddb","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"4dbfea1d-2e1b-4521-bbb2-48663498b7f0","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6f37bbaf-3b2a-4889-9da8-014105b65b82","agentId":"acb4e62e0c603bceb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SENiExzEZSX5aKLkLhhNvU","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"OR-Tools CP-SAT 9.16 release notes changelog 2025\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"OR-Tools Release Notes | Google for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://developers.google.com/optimization/support/release_notes\"},{\"title\":\"Releases · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/releases\"},{\"title\":\"Debugging the model\",\"url\":\"https://groups.google.com/g/or-tools-discuss/c/x84toCnIWnU/m/nyF4cJ-XAwAJ\"},{\"title\":\"ortools · PyPI\",\"url\":\"https://pypi.org/project/ortools/\"},{\"title\":\"ortools Changelog\",\"url\":\"https://data.safetycli.com/packages/pypi/ortools/changelog\"},{\"title\":\"or-tools-discuss - Google Groups\",\"url\":\"https://groups.google.com/g/or-tools-discuss\"},{\"title\":\"ortools.sat.python.cp_model API documentation\",\"url\":\"https://or-tools.github.io/docs/pdoc/ortools/sat/python/cp_model.html\"},{\"title\":\"v9.12 · google/or-tools · Discussion #4544\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/discussions/4544\"},{\"title\":\"Bottlenecks in CP-SAT Solver Performance Across Core Configurations · Issue #4783 · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/issues/4783\"},{\"title\":\"CP-SAT Solver | OR-Tools | Google for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://developers.google.com/optimization/cp/cp_solver\"}]\n\nBased on my web search results, I was unable to find specific release notes or changelog information for OR-Tools CP-SAT version 9.16 from 2025.\n\nThe search results show that:\n\n- The latest version available on PyPI is 9.15.6755 (released January 14, 2026)\n- Prior releases include 9.14.6206 (June 19, 2025) and 9.13.4784 (June 6, 2025)\n\nThe search results do not contain information about a version 9.16. It's possible that:\n\n1. Version 9.16 has not yet been released\n2. The version numbering you're looking for might be different\n3. The version exists but release notes are not yet indexed by search engines\n\nTo get the most current information, I recommend:\n- Checking the official [OR-Tools GitHub releases page](https://github.com/google/or-tools/releases)\n- Visiting the [OR-Tools release notes documentation](https://developers.google.com/optimization/support/release_notes)\n- Checking the [PyPI page for ortools](https://pypi.org/project/ortools/)\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"7fdaeee4-69ec-495e-aebd-841f21965bec","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:58:49.478Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"4dbfea1d-2e1b-4521-bbb2-48663498b7f0","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
