{"parentUuid":"965e2aab-2ecc-4c75-8f54-7d843465d0cc","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6f37bbaf-3b2a-4889-9da8-014105b65b82","agentId":"acb4e62e0c603bceb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Y97mK3wER3P12XFhK8KNnb","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"OR-Tools 9.15 release notes CP-SAT no_overlap_2d improvements LRAT\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"OR-Tools Release Notes | Google for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://developers.google.com/optimization/support/release_notes\"},{\"title\":\"Releases · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/releases\"},{\"title\":\"ortools Changelog\",\"url\":\"https://data.safetycli.com/packages/pypi/ortools/changelog\"},{\"title\":\"ortools.sat.python.cp_model API documentation\",\"url\":\"https://or-tools.github.io/docs/pdoc/ortools/sat/python/cp_model.html\"},{\"title\":\"CP-SAT: Parameter documentation NoOverlap2D, Cumulative · google/or-tools · Discussion #3107\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/discussions/3107\"},{\"title\":\"Performance of packing problems · google/or-tools · Discussion #3177\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/discussions/3177\"},{\"title\":\"OR-Tools Laurent Perron (lperron@google.com)\",\"url\":\"https://egon.cheme.cmu.edu/ewo/docs/CP-SAT%20and%20OR-Tools.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Lanzamientos · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://translate.google.com/translate?client=srp&hl=es&sl=en&tl=es&u=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fgoogle%2For-tools%2Freleases\"},{\"title\":\"v9.12 · google/or-tools · Discussion #4544\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/discussions/4544\"},{\"title\":\"CP-SAT Solver | OR-Tools | Google for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://developers.google.com/optimization/cp/cp_solver\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about OR-Tools 9.15 release notes related to the CP-SAT improvements you asked about:\n\n## OR-Tools 9.15 Release Notes\n\nOR-Tools v9.15 was released, and the CP-SAT solver includes the following notable improvements:\n\n### no_overlap_2d Constraint Improvements\nThe no_overlap_2d constraint received improvements to presolve, propagation, and cuts.\n\n### Precedence Detection\nThe solver can now detect, store and use precedences in presolve, propagation, and cuts.\n\n### LRAT Proof Production and Checking\nExtensive work was done on LRAT proof production and checking.\n\n### Overall CP-SAT Enhancements\nMore broadly, the CP-SAT solver has received significant improvements, including API changes, performance enhancements, and expanded functionality for constraints and linear expressions.\n\nThese improvements represent significant enhancements to the constraint programming capabilities of OR-Tools, particularly in the areas of 2D rectangle packing and SAT proof verification.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"67f3baab-a54f-42b1-9644-22c1d143ddcc","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:59:01.192Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"965e2aab-2ecc-4c75-8f54-7d843465d0cc","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
