{"parentUuid":"86022fc1-e8ca-4383-aeb8-de709385fa87","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6f37bbaf-3b2a-4889-9da8-014105b65b82","agentId":"acb4e62e0c603bceb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011CWQ1vf5qGcfmLYdyAxnxP","type":"tool_result","content":"# v9.14 Release Notes Summary\n\nBased on the GitHub release page, the v9.14 release notes contain the following information:\n\n**Dependencies:**\n- \"Bump Protobuf to v31.1\"\n\n**What's Changed:**\n- MacOS libscip linkage issue resolution (#4674)\n- CFT Heuristic for Set Covering implementation (#4607)\n- Set-Cover-CFT Outer Refinement Procedure (#4628)\n- Windows bz2.dll installation path correction (#4685)\n\n**Bug Fixes:**\n- Issues #4674 and #4677 addressed\n- Highs library was missing from archives artifacts (though included in PyPI, Maven, and Nuget)\n\n**New Contributors:**\n- @c4v4 contributed for the first time\n\nThe page does not contain detailed release notes covering CP-SAT, no_overlap_2d, scheduling, cuts, LCG, LP, presolve, shared tree, parameters, Python API, or breaking changes beyond what is listed above."}]},"uuid":"c40a64ff-90cd-41f2-ac30-b92f3961e3df","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:59:14.619Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"86022fc1-e8ca-4383-aeb8-de709385fa87","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"1262d338-3e0d-4d22-ad82-d5652921afbb","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6f37bbaf-3b2a-4889-9da8-014105b65b82","agentId":"acb4e62e0c603bceb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VsQxK9nawb99ZXS8kQ38w1","type":"tool_result","content":"# OR-Tools v9.15 Release Notes Summary\n\nReleased January 12 by @Mizux, this version includes substantial improvements across multiple components.\n\n## Key Highlights\n\n**Platforms & Dependencies:**\n- \"Add Python 3.14 support\" with improved gil-less support\n- Minimum Python version raised to 3.9 (dropped 3.8)\n- Updated dependencies: abseil-cpp 20250814.1, Protobuf v33.1, HiGHS v1.12.0, SCIP v10.0.0\n- XPressMP now supported in MathOpt with automatic library loading\n\n**CP-SAT Solver:**\nThe changelog emphasizes extensive work on constraint improvements, stating improvements to the \"no_overlap_2d constraint (presolve, propagation, and cuts).\" Additional enhancements include:\n- Precedence detection and utilization in presolve/propagation/cuts\n- \"Extensive work on LRAT proof production and checking\"\n- Set variables and constraints support (experimental)\n- Extended enforcement literal support\n- Shared tree worker and clause sharing improvements\n- Various bug fixes and heuristic improvements\n\n**Routing & Linear Solver:**\n- Improved routing performance with enhanced search event support\n- \"Add lazy constraints support in XPRESS interface\"\n- Support for Gurobi 12.0.2, 12.0.3, and 13.0.0\n\n**Known Issues:**\nThe release notes identify breaking changes in wrapper APIs affecting routing and SAT solver callback parameters, plus a macOS SWIG compatibility issue requiring version 4.3.1 or earlier."}]},"uuid":"98026543-60fc-47d0-a36e-1c9c691f6d27","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:59:17.881Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1262d338-3e0d-4d22-ad82-d5652921afbb","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":