s, I found information about the issue you're asking about:\n\nThere was a breaking argument change to the CpSolver.Solve() callback in issue #4988, which was addressed in OR-Tools v9.15.\n\nAdditionally, the search results show that in ortools 9.15, there was a change to how models are exported, with the new method being model.export_to_file() which auto-detects format by extension, replacing the previous approach of using model.Proto().SerializeToString().\n\nFor more specific details about the callback API change itself, you may want to check the GitHub issue #4988 directly or the official OR-Tools changelog/release notes for version 9.15, as the search results reference the change but don't provide the exact details of what the breaking change entailed.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"03518234-2de5-4f0b-acb1-ccfedea4ba50","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:59:50.099Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"954bfc57-3a01-4944-b7c0-925e4a722999","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
