{"parentUuid":"73e4fb8e-4f46-4a74-936f-9a696e73a04a","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"acb4e62e0c603bceb","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01PCgiHwVFfjonqLyNxD64tk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PHaVdseDxH1yDzhPiRrgoZ","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://d-krupke.github.io/cpsat-primer/05_parameters.html","prompt":"What are the key new parameters added in OR-Tools 9.13/9.14/9.15? List parameter names that the primer flags as recent or experimental, especially for no_overlap_2d, cumulative/scheduling, cuts, LP, presolve, shared tree."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2518,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2516,"cache_read_input_tokens":29549,"output_tokens":801,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2516},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2518,"output_tokens":801,"cache_read_input_tokens":29549,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2516,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2516,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011Caot3tQLv1GkXX2uw7gRD","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"12049a34-1d10-401b-b45f-57b50e79cb37","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:00:05.157Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"12049a34-1d10-401b-b45f-57b50e79cb37","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6f37bbaf-3b2a-4889-9da8-014105b65b82","agentId":"acb4e62e0c603bceb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PHaVdseDxH1yDzhPiRrgoZ","type":"tool_result","content":"# OR-Tools 9.13/9.14/9.15 Parameters\n\nBased on the provided content, the CP-SAT Primer does **not discuss new parameters added in OR-Tools versions 9.13, 9.14, or 9.15**. \n\nThe document references OR-Tools version 9.10 as its primary focus and mentions version 9.9 when discussing parallelization strategies. There are no sections flagging recent or experimental parameters for:\n\n- `no_overlap_2d` constraints\n- Cumulative/scheduling features\n- Cut generation\n- LP (linear programming) settings\n- Presolve techniques\n- Shared tree methods\n\nThe only version-specific note in the text concerns an API change: \"Changed in ortools 9.15: was model.Proto().SerializeToString()... Now use model.export_to_file() which auto-detects format by extension.\"\n\nFor information about parameters introduced in those specific versions, you would need to consult the official OR-Tools repository or more recent documentation beyond this primer."}]},"uuid":"21c7d23e-eff7-48ae-bf34-bc15113f3e83","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:00:09.150Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"12049a34-1d10-401b-b45f-57b50e79cb37","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"73e4fb8e-4f46-4a74-936f-9a696e73a04a","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6f37bbaf-3b2a-4889-9da8-014105b65b82","agentId":"acb4e62e0c603bceb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NUhs3Dyd83fF8FjXBuEtN3","type":"tool_result","content":"# OR-Tools Changelog: Versions 9.13-9.15\n\n## Version 9.15\n**CP-SAT Improvements:**\n- Column generation Bin Packing heuristic introduced based on CFT methodology\n- Pass solution hint to HiGHS from mathopt integration\n\n**Platform Changes:**\n- Added Python 3.14 support\n- Updated dependencies: abseil-cpp=20250814.1, Protobuf=v33.1, HiGHS=v1.12.0, SCIP=v10.0.0\n\n**Known Issues:**\n- \"routing: SetAllowedVehiclesForIndex not working in wrappers (changed parameters)\"\n- MacOS requires SWIG ≤4.3.1 due to Director issues\n\n## Version 9.14\n**Dependency Update:**\n- Protobuf bumped to v31.1\n\n**CP-SAT Work:**\n- CFT Heuristic for Set Covering problem developed\n- \"Outer Refinement Procedure\" implemented for Set Cover optimization\n\n**Bug Fixes:**\n- Resolved MacOS libscip linkage issue\n- Fixed bz2.dll installation path for Windows-cpp archives\n- HiGHS now properly included in archive artifacts\n\n## Version 9.13\n**Breaking Changes:**\n- Dropped Python 3.8 support\n- Dropped .Net 6.0 support; migrated to .Net 8.0\n- Java may drop Java 8 in favor of Java 11 minimum\n\n**CP-SAT Major Improvements:**\n- Comprehensive enhancements to \"no_overlap_2d constraint (presolve, propagation, and cuts)\"\n- \"Deep improvements to routing cuts. Detect transition between nodes. Detect capacity constraints\"\n- \"Improvement to scheduling cuts\"\n- \"Detect, store and use precedences, with their bounds (lb ≤ a*x + b*y ≤ ub) in presolve, propagation, and cuts\"\n- Speedup feasibility jump and violation LNS\n\n**Known Issues:**\n- libscip linkage error on Mac\n- ComputeMinSumOfWeightedEndMins error reported"}]},"uuid":"b452758d-44ad-46d5-8901-39fdada796bf","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:00:12.488Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"73e4fb8e-4f46-4a74-936f-9a696e73a04a","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"b452758d-44ad-46d5-8901-39fdada796bf","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"acb4e62e0c603bceb","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_013DGjXm48uAR5aq8ZRXPpqL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have enough information. The project uses `solver.Solve(model)` (capital S, deprecated form), uses `AddHint` extensively, and uses `no_overlap_2d` in 15+ files — exactly the areas where 9.13-9.15 brought heavy improvements. Let me confirm one more detail about the no_overlap_2d performance improvements over 9.12."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":357,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6315,"cache_read_input_tokens":32065,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6315,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011Caot5VZU2AFBM8KB93gwy","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"bed40951-8968-415e-af36-bc5863303453","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:00:16.793Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
