{"parentUuid":"bfe9a99f-8615-4b0c-b9c9-316ecaa057e6","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"acb4e62e0c603bceb","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_013DGjXm48uAR5aq8ZRXPpqL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01P51YDKC7zLd8q3sjAmRR6P","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://github.com/google/or-tools/discussions/4544","prompt":"What does this discussion say about v9.12 release and any performance benchmarks or no_overlap_2d, scheduling improvements? Quote the key bullets."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":357,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6315,"cache_read_input_tokens":32065,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6315,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011Caot5VZU2AFBM8KB93gwy","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"2d34c50f-778a-4dea-bf3d-80bfbb9e2016","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:00:22.405Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"bfe9a99f-8615-4b0c-b9c9-316ecaa057e6","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6f37bbaf-3b2a-4889-9da8-014105b65b82","agentId":"acb4e62e0c603bceb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B11Z2zDnVgm5gxnNtVdXFg","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"or-tools 9.13 9.14 no_overlap_2d benchmark performance packing cuts presolve\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Release v9.13 · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/releases/tag/v9.13\"},{\"title\":\"OR-Tools Release Notes | Google for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://developers.google.com/optimization/support/release_notes\"},{\"title\":\"Performance of packing problems · google/or-tools · Discussion #3177\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/discussions/3177\"},{\"title\":\"Releases · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/releases\"},{\"title\":\"CP-SAT: Parameter documentation NoOverlap2D, Cumulative · google/or-tools · Discussion #3107\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/discussions/3107\"},{\"title\":\"Yet Another Math Programming Consultant: 2d bin packing with Google OR-Tools CP-SAT, how to fix?\",\"url\":\"http://yetanothermathprogrammingconsultant.blogspot.com/2021/02/2d-bin-packing-with-google-or-tools-cp.html\"},{\"title\":\"Lanzamientos · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://translate.google.com/translate?u=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fgoogle%2For-tools%2Freleases&hl=es&sl=en&tl=es&client=srp\"},{\"title\":\"v9.12 · google/or-tools · Discussion #4544\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/discussions/4544\"},{\"title\":\"Add ability to opt-out from NoOverlap -> Alldiff conversion in presolve · Issue #5059 · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/issues/5059\"},{\"title\":\"OR-Tools Laurent Perron (lperron@google.com)\",\"url\":\"https://egon.cheme.cmu.edu/ewo/docs/CP-SAT%20and%20OR-Tools.pdf\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found relevant information about OR-Tools versions 9.13 and 9.14 regarding the `no_overlap_2d` constraint improvements related to packing, cuts, and presolve:\n\n## OR-Tools v9.13 Improvements\n\nVersion 9.13 includes improvements to the no_overlap_2d constraint (presolve, propagation, and cuts). Additionally, the version detects, stores and uses precedences, with their bounds (lb ≤ a * x + b * y ≤ ub) in presolve, propagation, and cuts.\n\n## OR-Tools v9.14 Improvements\n\nFor version 9.14, improvements to the no_overlap_2d constraint include presolve, propagation, and cuts. The solver can now detect, store and use precedences in presolve, propagation, and cuts.\n\n## Context on no_overlap_2d Performance\n\nThe search results also reference benchmark performance improvements: considerable performance improvements for 2D packing problems have been observed since version 9.2, with various constraint propagation and presolve techniques being enhanced to handle packing problems more efficiently.\n\nHowever, the search results do not contain specific benchmark performance metrics comparing the exact performance differences between versions 9.13 and 9.14 on packing problems.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"f976a4eb-0441-402a-b452-7665320145ab","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:00:23.667Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"bfe9a99f-8615-4b0c-b9c9-316ecaa057e6","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"2d34c50f-778a-4dea-bf3d-80bfbb9e2016","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6f37bbaf-3b2a-4889-9da8-014105b65b82","agentId":"acb4e62e0c603bceb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01P51YDKC7zLd8q3sjAmRR6P","type":"tool_result","content":"# v9.12 Release Discussion Summary\n\n## Key Improvements Mentioned\n\n**CP-SAT Enhancements:**\n- \"Improve the no_overlap_2d layer (propagation, presolve, cuts)\"\n- \"Improve Cumulative propagation and cuts\"\n- \"Add scheduling samples\"\n- \"Speed up LNS\"\n\n**Performance Feedback:**\nA user reported substantial performance gains, noting that a resource allocation routing problem using circuit constraints decreased from approximately 85 seconds in v9.11 to around 56 seconds in v9.12 when solving to optimality on an 8-thread system.\n\n**Other Notable Changes:**\n- Deprecated old graph classes in favor of `ReverseArcListGraph<>` and `ListGraph<>`\n- Updated dependencies (Protobuf 29.3, HiGHS 1.9.0, SCIP v920)\n- Added Xpress and HiGHS support to Math Opt and Model Builder\n- Last release supporting Python 3.8 and Java 1.8\n\nThe discussion includes a note about known issues, including one affecting CP-SAT's `add_abs_equality` function in specific scenarios."}]},"uuid":"b66db6b5-2bba-4277-a53d-2e1b38ac012d","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:00:28.097Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"2d34c50f-778a-4dea-bf3d-80bfbb9e2016","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"b66db6b5-2bba-4277-a53d-2e1b38ac012d","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"acb4e62e0c603bceb","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01JoAvcmVk3L7ivc72ZbMV6M","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have enough data. Now let me produce the final report.\n\n---\n\n# OR-Tools CP-SAT 9.15 之后调研报告\n\n## 关键结论先行\n\n**当前项目已经在最新稳定版 9.15.6755 上**（`requirements.lock.txt:15`，2026-01-12 发布），不存在\"偏旧\"问题。Round 4 的判断不准确——9.15 是 2026 年 1 月才发布的，距今 4 个月。**没有 9.16 release**，也没有 alpha/beta tag。GitHub main 分支 1 月以来主要是 graph/build/CMake/SCIP/HiGHS 的更新，没有明显的 sat 大改动。\n\n## 版本历史表（9.11 → 9.15）\n\n| 版本 | 日期 | sat / packing 改进 | 新参数 / 配置 | 风险 / 破坏性变更 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **9.11** | 2024-09-16 | （基线，项目从这之后才升过来）| — | — |\n| **9.12** | 2025-02-17 | no_overlap_2d 层 propagation/presolve/cuts 改进；Cumulative propagation/cuts 改进；hint transformation 重写（保留可行 hint）；shared tree workers 加 job affinity；LNS 加速 | scheduling samples 加入 | 删除老 graph 类（EbertGraph 等）；Python 3.8 最后一版；`add_abs_equality` 已知 bug |\n| **9.13** | 2025-06-06 | **no_overlap_2d 又一轮 presolve/propagation/cuts 改进**；**precedence 检测带边界 lb≤a·x+b·y≤ub** 用于 presolve/cuts；routing cuts 深度改进；scheduling cuts 改进；feasibility jump + violation LNS 加速；shared_tree/portfolio 子句共享改进 | Python：更好的浮点 coef 支持 | **drop Python 3.8 / .Net 6.0**；libscip Mac 链接错误；ComputeMinSumOfWeightedEndMins bug |\n| **9.14** | 2025-06-19 | CFT 启发式（Set Cover）；Set-Cover-CFT outer refinement | — | Protobuf 升 v31.1；archive 缺 HiGHS（已在 PyPI 修复） |\n| **9.15** | 2026-01-12 | no_overlap_2d 又一轮 presolve/propagation/cuts；precedence 检测继续；**LRAT proof 生产+检查大量工作**；linear1/linear2 编码改进；**set 变量+约束（实验性）**；enforcement literal 扩展到更多约束；shared tree + clause sharing 增强；Bin Packing 列生成启发式（CFT-based） | `check_lrat_proof` / `output_lrat_proof` (tag 344-345)；`check_drat_proof` / `output_drat_proof` (346-347)；`max_drat_time_in_seconds` (348)；`inprocessing_use_sat_sweeping` (354) | **Issue #4988**：`CpSolver.Solve()` 弃用，新 `solve()` 把参数 `solution_callback` 错误改名成 `callback`；**Python 3.9 起步（drop 3.8）**；macOS 需要 SWIG ≤4.3.1；abseil 20250814.1 / Protobuf v33.1 / HiGHS 1.12.0 / SCIP v10.0.0；Python 3.14 加入 |\n\n## 与本项目相关的关键参数（来自 sat_parameters.proto v9.15）\n\nplacement / packing 重点：\n- `use_try_edge_reasoning_in_no_overlap_2d` (default=false, tag 299)\n- `use_linear3_for_no_overlap_2d_precedences` (default=true, tag 323)\n- `maximum_regions_to_split_in_disconnected_no_overlap_2d` (default=0, tag 315) — 子区域分解 bin packing\n- `use_conservative_scale_overload_checker` (cumulative, tag 286)\n- `use_dynamic_precedence_in_cumulative` (实验, tag 268)\n\nLP / cuts：\n- `add_rlt_cuts` (default=true, tag 279) — RLT 提升\n- `lp_primal_tolerance` / `lp_dual_tolerance` (tag 266/267)\n\nshared tree（项目并行波相关）：\n- `shared_tree_num_workers` (-1 自动)\n- `shared_tree_balance_tolerance` (tag 305)\n- `shared_tree_split_min_dtime` (tag 328)\n\npresolve：\n- `inprocessing_use_congruence_closure` (default=true, tag 342)\n- `inprocessing_use_sat_sweeping` (default=false, tag 354) — 9.15 新增 \"Clausal Equivalence Sweeping\"\n\n## 项目升级影响评估\n\n**好消息：项目已经在 9.15。** 不存在升级工程量。\n\n**已经吃到的红利**（9.11 → 9.15 累计）：\n- 4 轮 no_overlap_2d 改进（项目里 15 个文件用到，见 `src/models/exact_coordinate_master.py` 等）\n- Hint 在 presolve 中保留（项目大量 `AddHint`，见 `exact_coordinate_master.py:6205-6239`）\n- shared tree job affinity + 子句共享（多 worker 配置受益）\n- precedence 检测带边界（packing 问题强相关）\n\n**潜在隐患（需要关注）**：\n\n1. **Issue #4988 callback API 改名**：项目全局都用大写 `solver.Solve(model)`（37+ 处），9.15 把它标记 deprecated。功能仍可用，但新代码应迁移到 `solver.solve(model, callback=...)`。**目前不阻塞**，下一版可能完全删除。\n\n2. **`model.Proto().SerializeToString()` 路径**：9.15 推荐改用 `model.export_to_file()`，需要全局搜一遍是否有用到（影响 checkpoint 序列化）。\n\n3. **Python 3.13 兼容性**：项目用 Python 3.13，9.15 支持 3.9-3.14，没问题。\n\n4. **Protobuf v33.1**：如果项目其他地方 pin 了旧 protobuf，可能冲突。需要 `pip check`。\n\n5. **2GB proto 限制**：调研中 9.13-9.15 release notes **均未提及解决**，仍是底层 protobuf 限制。无新方案。\n\n6. **新参数默认值 `use_linear3_for_no_overlap_2d_precedences=true`**：9.13 起默认开启，对 placement 有利但行为变了——如果项目里有\"基于旧解时间分布\"的硬编码超时阈值，需要重测。\n\n## 推荐行动\n\n- **不需要\"升级\"**：已经在 latest stable。\n- **可选短期收益**：把 `use_try_edge_reasoning_in_no_overlap_2d` 和 `maximum_regions_to_split_in_disconnected_no_overlap_2d` 加入 S6 worker 矩阵实验（这两个对 70x70 多矩形分布场景有戏）。\n- **跟踪 9.16**：根据 9.x 节奏，预计 2026-06 左右出。重点盯 sat_runner 性能 + 任何 LRAT 扩展到 CP（不只 SAT）的进展。\n- **callback API 迁移**：列入 Phase 3B 收尾的 housekeeping，不紧急。\n\n## 相关文件路径\n\n- `D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\requirements.lock.txt:15` — `ortools==9.15.6755`\n- `D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\src\\models\\master_model.py:1613-11224` — `num_search_workers` 配置点\n- `D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\src\\models\\exact_coordinate_master.py:6205-6239` — `AddHint` 集中区\n- `D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\src\\models\\binding_subproblem.py:453` 等 37 处 — `solver.Solve(...)` 旧 API\n\n## Sources\n\n- [google/or-tools releases page](https://github.com/google/or-tools/releases)\n- [v9.15 release tag](https://github.com/google/or-tools/releases/tag/v9.15)\n- [v9.14 release tag](https://github.com/google/or-tools/releases/tag/v9.14)\n- [v9.13 release tag](https://github.com/google/or-tools/releases/tag/v9.13)\n- [v9.12 discussion #4544](https://github.com/google/or-tools/discussions/4544)\n- [Issue #4988 – callback API change](https://github.com/google/or-tools/issues/4988)\n- [Issue #5059 – NoOverlap → Alldiff opt-out](https://github.com/google/or-tools/issues/5059)\n- [ortools on PyPI](https://pypi.org/project/ortools/)\n- [OR-Tools Release Notes (Google Developers)](https://developers.google.com/optimization/support/release_notes)\n- [ortools changelog (safetycli)](https://data.safetycli.com/packages/pypi/ortools/changelog)\n- [CP-SAT Primer – Parameters (d-krupke)](https://d-krupke.github.io/cpsat-primer/05_parameters.html)\n- [Discussion #3107 – NoOverlap2D / Cumulative parameters](https://github.com/google/or-tools/discussions/3107)\n- [Discussion #3177 – Packing performance](https://github.com/google/or-tools/discussions/3177)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2327,"cache_read_input_tokens":38380,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2327,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011Caot6dx2QUfpK1MQGMg8y","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"0ba90195-4396-4c90-9806-3156464b83eb","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:01:24.718Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
